# Instance agenthub-docker-1 of ci-agenthub-runner@.service on minisforum-ms01. Install as
# ~ci-agenthub/.config/ci-agenthub/agenthub-docker-1.env. GitHub runner name: minisforum-ms01-agenthub-docker-1.
